{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>平常在螢光幕前總是給人低調、靦腆印象的金馬影帝梁朝偉，沒想到只要一坐上駕駛座，立刻化身熱血爆表的高階車迷！繼先前駕駛全球限量僅25輛的經典風冷Porsche 993現身香港山路引發轟動後，近日他又被攝影師野生捕捉到開著另一輛極度稀有的保時捷神車馳騁山頭，超帥氣的身影迅速在社群平台引爆全網熱議！</p><p>全球限量1963輛！海岸藍金屬車色搭經典套件吸睛度破表</p><p>據了解，梁朝偉這次被捕捉到的座駕，是保時捷為紀念911車系誕生60週年特別打造的限量重磅神車Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛！</p><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉再被捕獲開限量跑車現身香港山路。（微博@劉嘉玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142774940945223680380752.jpeg/FuBUl8VpR1TRJnf26s_dy4ug5ylpl3nilGVvgZRlb4E\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉再被捕獲開限量跑車現身香港山路。（微博@劉嘉玲）</figcaption></figure><p>梁朝偉本次駕駛Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛，報價$5,669,000起，更多梁朝偉其他跑車照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉這次被捕捉到的座駕是Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛。（Porsche官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189637191278530560975041.jpeg/rrEOnZtkh0STCVVq_NX2GqJt9vgf7s5VYA1gWWANYFk\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉這次被捕捉到的座駕是Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛。（Porsche官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉這次被捕捉到的座駕是Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛，報價$5,669,000起（未含額外選配項目）。（Porsche官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189637193564557312574302.jpeg/iJ5okyUUKqxeM8z_XUswiSXL4GziHTg1WPyVz1j8lc8\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉這次被捕捉到的座駕是Porsche 911 S/T，全球僅有1963輛，報價$5,669,000起（未含額外選配項目）。（Porsche官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前一次「MD」活動中，不止一名攝影師捕捉到一架保時捷「993 Gunther Werks」駛過，這部車全球限量25架，價值過千萬。（Threads@ ahthew_photography）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164232919594831872457130.jpeg/09JM5LgSOmbLIwtMmjofNtMNOAm-qU7AvuvSbL7r0mw\"/><figcaption>日前一次「MD」活動中，不止一名攝影師捕捉到一架保時捷「993 Gunther Werks」駛過，這部車全球限量25架，價值過千萬。（Threads@ ahthew_photography）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前有攝影師在石澳路段，成功捕捉到梁朝偉與友人駕新車遊車河的照片。梁朝偉坐在新購入的紅色限量版保時捷「911 Speedster」的副駕座。（threads/@ahthew_photography）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173975713888342016835917.jpeg/pQfjyt72fx2-705IKXlI60LLrlvZTh5UFnio5hZ4qOY\"/><figcaption>日前有攝影師在石澳路段，成功捕捉到梁朝偉與友人駕新車遊車河的照片。梁朝偉坐在新購入的紅色限量版保時捷「911 Speedster」的副駕座。（threads/@ahthew_photography）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉鐘愛跑車，經常低調睇車。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251016/1055591506275995648043825.png/_QbWoNqeUpvvhxW_keNcYCZThk7CG_wNQfF-wkHxfsI\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉鐘愛跑車，經常低調睇車。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142773544615153664469285.jpeg/zTKqKwxOEA4oBzUzVD9bj814mpTWWH1wrqW-u66lvrs\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142774943319330816287394.jpeg/Kq74BIx5Wvs_FoeCshHcESfVsC_7Ht-Jd7_vOHe_7zg\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142774938319458304819026.jpeg/nZwpE76NGzfnMvLYHv4JclW8QJo8ae3A-I1fMfiNXzE\"/><figcaption>梁朝偉（微博@劉嘉玲）</figcaption></figure><p>車身選用獨特的海岸藍金屬車色（Shore Blue Metallic），並搭配Heritage Design經典套件與陶瓷色輪圈，低調卻難掩奢華質感，光是流暢的外型線條就讓廣大車迷直呼難以抗拒。</p><p>525匹馬力＋六速手排（棍波）！純粹駕馭樂趣車款為狂熱玩家量身打造</p><p>這款限量特別版跑車搭載4.0升自然進氣水平對臥（自然吸氣水平對向）六缸引擎，擁有高達525匹的強悍馬力，並配備極具挑戰性與操駕樂趣的六速手排變速箱。這台專為熱愛極致駕馭樂趣玩家量身打造的夢幻逸品，完美襯托出梁朝偉對於手排機械感與純粹操駕的熱愛。</p><p>不少網友與車迷紛紛驚嘆直呼：</p><blockquote><p>別人買限量超跑是放在車庫供著，偉仔是真正開出來享受生活！</p></blockquote><p>再次展現影帝私底下懂車、愛車又懂享受生活的瀟灑魅力。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：劉嘉玲爆梁朝偉需要照顧　換燈膽都要靠老婆：好似失去自理能力（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146420547169685504163708.jpeg/KtmmpiPBp0vv0UPoV2fOHu_S0AlIYowNYzm0fWM5tH0\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：劉嘉玲爆梁朝偉需要照顧　換燈膽都要靠老婆：好似失去自理能力（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲談及與梁朝偉的愛情，覺得每個年齡階段都有其動人的愛情。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146420544564891648735192.jpeg/FIz-1Im2q5MNc3Q9V7C76jbmPDg6TeznAq5EiQKuRIk\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲談及與梁朝偉的愛情，覺得每個年齡階段都有其動人的愛情。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲與梁朝偉相愛近40年。（IG/@carinalau1208）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146438188240211968231789.jpeg/MJHhLke7iIqE5NtRJmTRxcTyuId243pU9shx4_bIceM\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲與梁朝偉相愛近40年。（IG/@carinalau1208）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲笑言梁朝偉隨著年紀愈大愈需要她照顧。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146450993253322752359826.jpeg/evxTeWiCpdqyau7UxazVHISOK4nobWbYHmSirh5koq4\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲笑言梁朝偉隨著年紀愈大愈需要她照顧。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘉玲搞笑指梁朝偉與工人溝通都要靠她。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146450990824689664125906.jpeg/ZrKos6eKWO2Hns2ZuOUnQ0xxP6lH-SzUODLlxzgy5cc\"/><figcaption>嘉玲搞笑指梁朝偉與工人溝通都要靠她。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲竟然透露自己特別做了測試兩次，結果竟然顯示自己為「INFJ」。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146422396601896960649387.jpeg/xNWtVetr6asHJiDYHV22aBqf0ziCzKmE_zK9EP8yvRA\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲竟然透露自己特別做了測試兩次，結果竟然顯示自己為「INFJ」。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲笑指外界一直看錯了。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146422394169069568732054.jpeg/w0zPwQzl5ViN65g5KWphl23ybPJQY91jkfP045Hz9OM\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲笑指外界一直看錯了。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘉玲透露與梁朝偉近40年愛情中，曾有過無數想放棄的瞬間。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146428077535137792216047.jpeg/8avkgaQdC8Dvyo8g3RI1W-NovBnARVzrRVDjO0VQ4zs\"/><figcaption>嘉玲透露與梁朝偉近40年愛情中，曾有過無數想放棄的瞬間。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲自認難相處。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146428075047784448936021.jpeg/zqs2ElG0Wpp7Iu4UNOQxOKQzYLcDOw-sGZ_sCBmf7Ag\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲自認難相處。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘉玲感激梁朝偉忍受自己的脾氣。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146428072329744384298547.jpeg/9lDzEqOjc38ch1GE_vRfwk501XIIcDjP3NBBRdzQQUU\"/><figcaption>嘉玲感激梁朝偉忍受自己的脾氣。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘉玲透露兩人經過掙扎吵架培養出不言而喻的默契。（IG/@carinalau1208）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146436984365912064137640.jpeg/u9FY0sUmU6K-OMGFY2PjW_7weL_AJdkZTSLVK00i1Ss\"/><figcaption>嘉玲透露兩人經過掙扎吵架培養出不言而喻的默契。（IG/@carinalau1208）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"對於與梁朝偉的感情，嘉玲非常感激上天讓自己修回來的福氣。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146431207542624256790842.jpeg/5UtQij0NzO-mudAEuXvViMt7rgkHgixcbd4VUW3eFVE\"/><figcaption>對於與梁朝偉的感情，嘉玲非常感激上天讓自己修回來的福氣。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲將林青霞的一句話而銘記於心，不介意做後盾成就梁朝偉。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146431499659120640325914.jpeg/4CQAzKb1_3gt1uP6voyLRs0zCEfGc2pVqZWIqamViKk\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲將林青霞的一句話而銘記於心，不介意做後盾成就梁朝偉。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉嘉玲為梁朝偉感到非常驕傲。（《The Do Show》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146435194153078784043852.jpeg/_RJDKpdJeWxU1it5wGfq5j70CnC39dHzrZ9LuK2fS7g\"/><figcaption>劉嘉玲為梁朝偉感到非常驕傲。（《The Do Show》截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>夢幻聯動！梁朝偉、劉嘉玲合體天王威肯　「神級合照」網朝聖：以為AI</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:21:50.119132+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1661,"images":23,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:15:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T13:57:55.241764+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:17:47.392127+00:00","content_hash":"6cef28e2ffa922f7315a5ac8a86ebf9e28b6e4bb9bfa32231194d50134f94252","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}